    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open Fishing 2 is a chill open world fishing game. Fill out a book with 115 fish species, meet friendly fish gods, sail the oceans with your boat, cook, draw your own map, and enjoy fishing without worries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370190/extras/6719ceed588e642ffea86f027af9870b.poster.avif?t=1741316129\" width=598 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370190/extras/6719ceed588e642ffea86f027af9870b.webm?t=1741316129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370190/extras/6719ceed588e642ffea86f027af9870b.mp4?t=1741316129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing (obviously)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sailing and other maritime mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >115 fish to catch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved progression mechanics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370190/extras/1d95b20c9cb8cc767db387c54ceb8f1e.poster.avif?t=1741316129\" width=598 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370190/extras/1d95b20c9cb8cc767db387c54ceb8f1e.webm?t=1741316129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370190/extras/1d95b20c9cb8cc767db387c54ceb8f1e.mp4?t=1741316129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
